<title>AUSTRIA: Iraq can quickly reach 1.2 mln bpd - Hiti.</title>
<headline>Iraq can quickly reach 1.2 mln bpd - Hiti.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The head of the Iraqi OPEC delegation Osama al-Hiti said Iraq can reach its 1.2 million bpd output allocation any time it gets the green light from the U.N.</p>
<p>&quot;We are ready for the lift up, if the tanker comes tommorrow we can fill it up,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>He added that filling the 1.2 million bpd allocations was &quot;no problem.&quot;</p>
<p>He said that Iraqi capacity exceeded that figure but declined to give further details.  </p>
<p>He said he hoped Iraq would be exporting oil &quot;very soon, because we have finished all the necessary work and after the approving of the pricing formula there is very little left.&quot;</p>
<p>He said Iraq would be looking at signing contracts for the oil when the U.N. gave the go-ahead.</p>
<p>-- Vienna Newsroom +431 713 2034</p>
